# Assert crash screen on the 3DS (spec 002): L+R+A fails an NNH_VERIFY; the engine logs a fatal line and shows its
# red crash screen (START returns to the Homebrew Launcher). No Luma3DS setting needed.
#   build/pc-debug/tools/nnh/nnh run foundation --script examples/foundation/tests/assert_crash.nnhs
wait 60
press L
press R
wait 2
tap A
expect "deliberate crash from the demo" 60
